"title": "EKG 5 · ACS/STEMI — wall/lead/reciprocal, เกณฑ์ ST elevation, chronological change, ตำแหน่ง-หลอดเลือด, de Winter/Wellens/Sgarbossa (p105, p107, p110, p112, p120–121)",
